Proof: original9regressions failed; batched fixture preserves40000heartbeat events without autocommit fsync overhead. Expanded legacy/blocker controls and all8flow consumer files plus isolated Sources prototype passed169tests. Plugin shared-context/snapshot test failed2reads vs1 before consumer wiring, then lanes+unfiltered repo-guards green. Full scripts/check ran21checks; only stale-base unrelated sidebar/dispatch health ratchets failed; rebase before ship.
